{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/1ilbb1","slide":2,"text":"Timing: 2 minutes\n\nAsk for a show of hands: who has accepted AI-generated code because the demo worked once? Use that tension to frame the lab around control and evidence.\n\n[Sources]\n- Internal workshop brief and local Taskroom codebase; no external sources."}
