{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/he9n96","slide":11,"text":"Timing: 15 minutes\n\nApply facilitator/duplicate-id-bug.patch before showing this slide. The injected generator uses tasks.length + 1. After deletion, IDs can be reused; duplicate IDs cause React key confusion and ID-based deletion removes both matching records. Reveal hints only as needed: inspect state after each operation; compare identity with list size; try delete → create → delete. Require a regression test before the fix.\n\n[Sources]\n- Internal workshop brief and local Taskroom codebase; no external sources."}
